  {
   "id": "easy-delivery-co-330673@major-2025-08-05",
   "gameId": "easy-delivery-co-330673",
   "displayName": "Progress Update on Easy Delivery Co.! 150K wishlists, truck upgrades & more",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-08-05T12:53:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hope y’all are doing well. Little note today to say that progress on Easy Delivery Co. is going well. The game is now feature complete! That means it’s now time to put all the bits and pieces together. On top of this nice milestone, 150,000 people have wishlisted the game!! Thank you so much for your support it means a lot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So, if you don’t mind, I’d like to share with you some of the new stuff that will be featured in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Truck Upgrades",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You will be able to buy some upgrades for your truck at a very reasonable price from store keepers around the area. Snow tires are now available for purchase to reach new areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45300666/1732ffd78641cf248fc95499851a77c9e5db5086.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Spending Money and Consumables",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cool tools for your truck are not the only things you can purchase, coffee is a brand new alternative to energy drinks to live your liquid-based diet to the fullest.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45300666/f24c346f58750393f247a0384f05c60f2f5874b6.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Chill between deliveries",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In between deliveries, you can explore the various regions (yes, plural) to your heart’s desire. If you wish to slow things down a little more, feel free to buy some bird seed and hang out with the local crows. Also just, recently added - fishing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fishing Village",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New area!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45300666/a45c8be3b1d4f5d53fd74508452db45b4ade3253.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "People have also shared some cool art on the discord!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45300666/b829ab85920e456908960c7afc21049d5f0e6d65.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45300666/7de1fcc11e2d5b146e6a1217168758495a662e4f.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
