  {
   "id": "easy-delivery-co-330673@major-2025-05-08",
   "gameId": "easy-delivery-co-330673",
   "displayName": "New Demo Update! Steering sensitivity, controller mapping, fixes.. and horn",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-08T08:25:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello hello everyone",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What a couple of weeks it's been! Tons of people have played the Easy Delivery Co. demo, about 30.000 of you to be exact, and it's been a blast to see your reviews, your art, your feedback on the game. Thank you for playing and thank you for taking the time to leave reviews, it has really helped Easy Delivery Co. a lot. And we can't wait to show more about the game very soon :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update includes some fixes of course, but also fun stuff like new music, the truck can now honk, and steering sensitivity settings. You can find all the patch notes at the bottom of this post!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Some Questions & Answers",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Does the demo run on Steam Deck?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes, we've seen people play on Deck or ROG Ally seamlessly so far.: When will the game launch?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Late 2025: Will there be more to do with the truck?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes: How many secrets will be in the full game?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes: Will there be achievements?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes: Will there be more areas to explore?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "added brand new music tracks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "added horn",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "added speed chime",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "steering sensitivity setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "crt effect setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "alternate controller mapping",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "dog sequence fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed packages on npc head softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "packages can be placed under the fuel station",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for reading and see you next time! I will leave you with some lovely fan art from the community in the meantime. Come hang out in the Discord to check out some videos, art, and speedruns of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fan art & fun images!!!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "by _Asilent_ on Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
